WEBVTT

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:04.504
Your guest opens your booking link

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:08.495
They pick a free day

00:00:08.495 --> 00:00:13.001
Then a time, shown in their own time zone

00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:18.890
They type a name and an email

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:23.373
One click books the meeting

00:00:23.373 --> 00:00:25.975
Booked, without signing up for anything

00:00:25.975 --> 00:00:31.690
You both get an email right away

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:35.092
It has the time, the meeting link and a cancel link

00:00:35.092 --> 00:00:42.382 line:0
A calendar invite comes attached

00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:46.882
One small container. Your bookings in one file
